# UP6b: a commit racing the withdrawal. (a) The commit lands first: bob's resume answers
# E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT and his external join succeeds (the Remove is committed, so there is no
# E_REMOVE_PENDING). (b) The withdrawal lands first: a commit built on the old queue is refused
# 409 withdrawn, and the rebuilt commit succeeds and leaves carol in.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group call kind=call target=ecececececececececececececececec community=none creator=alice
join bob call via=external
sync alice
join carol call via=external
sync alice
sync bob
absent bob call
sync alice
commit alice call
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT resume bob call
resync bob call
sync alice
sync carol
absent carol call
sync alice
stash_commit alice call
resume carol call withdrawn=1
expect_reject E_COMMIT_CONFLICT rule=withdrawn post_stash alice call
sync alice
commit alice call
sync bob
sync carol
send alice call everyone is in
expect_decrypts bob call everyone is in
expect_decrypts carol call everyone is in
